            {
              "content": "=You are a real estate lead qualification specialist.\n\nAnalyze this lead.\n\nScore the lead from 0 to 100.\n\nRules:\n80-100 = HOT\n50-79 = WARM\n0-49 = COLD\n\nConsider:\n- Buying/renting intent\n- Budget\n- Property requirement\n- Location\n- Urgency/timeline\n- Overall seriousness\n\nIMPORTANT:\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object.\nDo not use markdown.\nDo not add explanations outside JSON.\nDo not include thinking or reasoning.\n\nRequired format:\n{\n  \"lead_score\": 85,\n  \"lead_status\": \"HOT\",\n  \"reason\": \"Short explanation\"\n\n}\n\nLead:\nName: {{ $json.name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.email }}\nPhone: {{ $json.phone }}\nProperty Type: {{ $json.property_type }}\nLocation: {{ $json.location }}\nBudget: {{ $json.budget }}\nPurpose: {{ $json.purpose }}\nMessage: {{ $json.message }}"
