    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.Email }}",
        "subject": "=Your Property Search in {{ $json.Location }} — Let’s Find the Right Option",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif; background-color: #f4f6f9; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }\n    .container { max-width: 600px; background: #ffffff; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }\n    .header { background: #dc2626; color: #ffffff; padding: 25px; text-align: center; }\n    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; }\n    .content { padding: 30px; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6; }\n    .req-box { background: #fef2f2; border-left: 4px solid #dc2626; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px; }\n    .req-box p { margin: 4px 0; font-size: 14px; }\n    \n    /* V6 Recommendation Dynamic Box */\n    .prop-card { background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 6px; padding: 18px; margin: 20px 0; }\n    .prop-title { margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #0f172a; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; }\n    .prop-detail { font-size: 14px; color: #475569; margin: 3px 0; }\n    \n    .footer { background: #f8fafc; text-align: center; padding: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <h1>Priority Property Match</h1>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <p>Hi <strong>{{ $json.Name }}</strong>,</p>\n      \n      <p>Thank you for sharing your property requirements with us.</p>\n      \n      <p>Based on the details you provided, we’d be happy to help you find a <b>{{ $json['Property Type'] }}</b> in <b>{{ $json.Location }}</b> within your budget of <b>PKR {{ $json.Budget }}</b>.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"req-box\">\n        <strong>Your Requirements:</strong>\n        <p>🏠 <b>Property:</b> {{ $json['Property Type'] }}</p>\n        <p>📍 <b>Location:</b> {{ $json.Location }}</p>\n        <p>💰 <b>Budget:</b> PKR {{ $json.Budget }}</p>\n        <p>🎯 <b>Purpose:</b> {{ $json.Purpose }}</p>\n      </div>\n<!-- V6 Match Found Section -->\n{{ $('Match Properties').item.json.has_recommendations ? '<div class=\"prop-card\"><div class=\"prop-title\">🌟 Direct Matched Property Listing</div><div class=\"prop-detail\"><b>Title:</b> ' + $('Match Properties').item.json.recommended_properties[0].Title + '</div><div class=\"prop-detail\">📍 <b>Location:</b> ' + $('Match Properties').item.json.recommended_properties[0].Location + '</div><div class=\"prop-detail\">🛏️ <b>Bedrooms:</b> ' + $('Match Properties').item.json.recommended_properties[0].Bedrooms + ' Bed</div><div class=\"prop-detail\">💵 <b>Price:</b> PKR ' + $('Match Properties').item.json.recommended_properties[0].Price + '</div><div style=\"margin-top: 10px;\"><a href=\"' + $('Match Properties').item.json.recommended_properties[0].Listing_URL + '\" style=\"color: #dc2626; font-weight: bold;\">View Details & Photos →</a></div></div>' : '' }}\n      <p>Since you’re looking to move forward soon, one of our property specialists can contact you shortly to discuss suitable options and answer any questions you may have.</p>\n      \n      <p>If you’re available, simply reply to this email with a suitable time for a quick call.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <strong>Best regards,</strong><br>\n      Real Estate Sales Team<br>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8;\">Helping you find the right property with confidence.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
